1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:01,800
Matthew 8

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:06,480
When he came down from the mountain, great crowds followed him.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,860
And behold, a leper came to him and knelt before him, saying,

4
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:14,840
Lord, if you will, you can make me clean.

5
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:18,940
And Jesus stretched out his hand and touched him, saying,

6
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,560
I will be clean.

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:25,060
And immediately his leprosy was cleansed.

8
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,100
And Jesus said to him,

9
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,600
See that you say nothing to anyone.

10
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:34,040
But go, show yourself to the priests and offer the gift that Moses commanded,

11
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,600
for a proof to them.

12
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:41,340
When he entered Capernaum, a centurion came forward to him, appealing to him,

13
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:46,900
Lord, my servant is lying paralyzed at home, suffering terribly.

14
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,780
And he said to him,

15
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,960
I will come and heal him.

16
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:53,260
But the centurion replied,

17
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:57,360
Lord, I am not worthy to have you come under my roof,

18
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:59,060
but only say the word,

19
00:00:59,380 --> 00:00:59,980
and my servant,

20
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,740
will be healed.

21
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:03,620
For I, too, am a man under authority,

22
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,140
with soldiers under me.

23
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,460
And I say to one,

24
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,880
Go, and he goes.

25
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:08,860
And to another,

26
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,580
Come, and he comes.

27
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:11,840
And to my servant,

28
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,820
Do this, and he does it.

29
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,720
When Jesus heard this,

30
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:18,300
he marveled and said to those who followed him,

31
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:20,300
Truly I tell you,

32
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:23,520
with no one in Israel have I found such faith.

33
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,180
I tell you,

34
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,540
many will come from east and west

35
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:29,460
and recline at table with Abraham,

36
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:29,980
Isaac,

37
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:30,560
and Jacob,

38
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,040
in the kingdom of heaven,

39
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:34,000
while the sons of the kingdom

40
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,900
will be thrown into the outer darkness.

41
00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:38,660
In that place there will be weeping

42
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:40,080
and gnashing of teeth.

43
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,960
And to the centurion Jesus said,

44
00:01:43,780 --> 00:01:47,160
Go, let it be done for you as you have believed.

45
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:51,220
And the servant was healed at that very moment.

46
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:53,720
And when Jesus entered Peter's house,

47
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:57,020
he saw his mother-in-law lying sick with a fever.

48
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,580
He touched her hand,

49
00:01:59,060 --> 00:01:59,960
and the fever left,

50
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:03,020
and she rose and began to serve him.

51
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,600
That evening they brought to him

52
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,420
many who were oppressed by demons,

53
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:09,800
and he cast out the spirits with a word,

54
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,480
and healed all who were sick.

55
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:15,420
This was to fulfill what was spoken by the prophet Isaiah.

56
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:19,440
He took our illnesses and bore our diseases.

57
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:23,600
Now when Jesus saw a crowd around him,

58
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:26,020
he gave orders to go over to the other side.

59
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,520
And a scribe came up and said to him,

60
00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:29,660
Teacher,

61
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,740
I will follow you wherever you go.

62
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:34,960
And Jesus said to him,

63
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:36,880
Foxes have holes,

64
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:38,880
and birds of the air have nests,

65
00:02:39,420 --> 00:02:42,260
but the Son of Man has nowhere to lay his head.

66
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,900
Another of the disciples said to him,

67
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:48,080
Lord, let me first go and bury my father.

68
00:02:48,780 --> 00:02:50,020
And Jesus said to him,

69
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,820
Follow me,

70
00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:54,760
and leave the dead to bury their own dead.

71
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:58,120
And when he got into the boat,

72
00:02:58,220 --> 00:02:59,380
his disciples followed him.

73
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,460
Behold, there arose a great storm on the sea,

74
00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:04,980
so that the boat was being swamped by the waves.

75
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:06,300
But he was asleep.

76
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:08,620
And they went and woke him, saying,

77
00:03:09,420 --> 00:03:11,720
Save us, Lord, we are perishing.

78
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:13,840
And he said to them,

79
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:18,040
Why are you afraid, O you of little faith?

80
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:22,500
Then he rose and rebuked the winds and the sea.

81
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,280
And there was a great calm.

82
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:28,800
And the men marveled, saying,

83
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:29,840
What?

84
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,340
What sort of man is this,

85
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:33,720
that even winds and sea obey him?

86
00:03:34,380 --> 00:03:36,020
And when he came to the other side,

87
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,760
to the country of the Gadarenes,

88
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:40,160
two demon-possessed men met him,

89
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,500
coming out of the tombs,

90
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:44,540
so fierce that no one could pass that way.

91
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:46,460
And behold, they cried out,

92
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:51,340
What have you to do with us, O Son of God?

93
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:55,980
Have you come here to torment us before the time?

94
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:59,100
Now a herd of many pigs was feeding

95
00:03:59,100 --> 00:03:59,820
at some distance,

96
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:02,460
and the demons begged him, saying,

97
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:08,880
If you cast us out, send us away into the herd of pigs.

98
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,120
And he said to them,

99
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:12,400
Go.

100
00:04:13,260 --> 00:04:15,680
So they came out and went into the pigs,

101
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:18,900
and behold, the whole herd rushed down the steep bank

102
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:20,880
into the sea and drowned in the waters.

103
00:04:21,580 --> 00:04:23,960
The herdsmen fled, and going into the city,

104
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,020
they told everything,

105
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,880
especially what had happened to the demon-possessed men.

106
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,020
And behold,

107
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:31,300
all the city came out to meet Jesus,

108
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:32,580
and when they saw him,

109
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,600
they begged him to leave their region.

